BT /F2 18 Tf 0.04 0.16 0.32 rg 1 0 0 1 42 777.00 Tm (SAHAYAK Master Guide) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 747.00 Tm (For Johan Jyoti Kuli - Lead Developer and Project Head) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 726.00 Tm (This guide explains the whole project in plain language. Use it to understand the system,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 713.90 Tm (    introduce the project, explain your own work honestly, and answer judge questions. You do not) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 701.80 Tm (    need to memorise every line of code, but you should know what each part does and how the parts) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 689.70 Tm (    fit together.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 667.60 Tm (1. Opening speech) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 650.60 Tm (Good morning respected judges, teachers, and everyone here. My name is Johan Jyoti Kuli, and I am) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 638.50 Tm (    the lead developer and project head of SAHAYAK. SAHAYAK is a real-time Indian Sign Language) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 626.40 Tm (    recognition prototype. It uses a camera, hand-point detection, a trained model and a website) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 614.30 Tm (    to predict a limited set of sign labels. I will explain how a hand becomes numbers, how the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 602.20 Tm (    model makes a guess, how the website and server share information, and how we test and improve) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 590.10 Tm (    the system.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 568.00 Tm (2. What problem are we exploring?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 551.00 Tm (People who use sign language may meet someone who does not understand their signs. SAHAYAK) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 538.90 Tm (    explores whether a computer can recognize some trained signs and show their labels. Indian) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 526.80 Tm (    Sign Language is a full language with its own rules. Recognizing a small set of hand signs is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 514.70 Tm (    not the same as understanding a full conversation. SAHAYAK is not a universal translator and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 502.60 Tm (    is not a replacement for a trained interpreter.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 480.50 Tm (3. Simple technical words) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 463.50 Tm (Computer vision: using software to find information in images or video.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 450.40 Tm (Landmark: a key point on the hand, such as a fingertip or joint.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 437.30 Tm (Feature: a number that describes something useful about the hand.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 424.20 Tm (Dataset: examples with the correct label written beside each one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 411.10 Tm (Training: showing labelled examples to a program so it can learn patterns.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 398.00 Tm (Model: the saved result of training.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 384.90 Tm (Prediction: the model's best guess for a new example.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 371.80 Tm (Frontend: the website pages and controls that a user sees.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 358.70 Tm (Backend: the server that receives information and runs the prediction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 345.60 Tm (API: a web address used by the website to send information to the server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 332.50 Tm (Candidate model: a trial model that is not active yet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 319.40 Tm (Promote: approve the trial model and make it active.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 306.30 Tm (Deploy: publish approved files to the hosted site or server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 293.20 Tm (Confidence: a score showing how strongly the model favours a label. It is not a promise that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 281.10 Tm (    answer is right.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 259.00 Tm (4. Follow one prediction from start to end) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 242.00 Tm (1. Camera: the browser asks the user for camera permission and shows the video.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 228.90 Tm (2. Hand points: MediaPipe Hands finds key points on visible hands in the browser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 215.80 Tm (3. Feature numbers: JavaScript prepares numbers that describe hand shape and position.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 202.70 Tm (4. API request: the browser sends those numbers to the backend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 189.60 Tm (5. Model: the Python Flask backend loads the saved model and asks it to predict a label.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 176.50 Tm (6. Response: the backend sends the label and any available confidence information back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 163.40 Tm (7. Display: the website shows the result. Translation or speech may happen separately.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 146.30 Tm (Remember the order: CAMERA -> HAND POINTS -> FEATURE NUMBERS -> BACKEND API -> MODEL -> PREDICTED) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 134.20 Tm (    LABEL -> WEBSITE.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 117.10 Tm (If the points look correct but the label is wrong, that does not mean the same step failed. Hand) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 105.00 Tm (    tracking and sign prediction are separate parts.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 82.90 Tm (5. Why 126 static values?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 65.90 Tm (A static sign is a pose that can be described in one frame. MediaPipe estimates 21 key points per) Tj ET
