q 0.04 0.16 0.32 rg 0 808 595 34 re f Q
BT /F2 8 Tf 1 1 1 rg 1 0 0 1 42 820 Tm (SAHAYAK | SIMPLE LANGUAGE GUIDE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 780.00 Tm (    hand. Each point has x, y and z coordinates. One hand has 21 x 3 = 63 values. Two hand slots) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 767.90 Tm (    have 63 x 2 = 126 values. The model uses these values to choose a label. The number 126 is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 755.80 Tm (    the number of signs, the number of samples or the accuracy.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 733.70 Tm (6. Why 1,320 values for a moving sign?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 716.70 Tm (A moving sign depends on how the hands change over time. Each sequence frame has 132 values: 126) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 704.60 Tm (    hand-point values plus six wrist-position values. The system arranges the sequence into 10) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 692.50 Tm (    time steps. 132 x 10 = 1,320 values for the sequence model. This describes the model input) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 680.40 Tm (    format; it does not prove the model knows every moving sign.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 658.30 Tm (7. What each part does) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 641.30 Tm (- HTML gives the website its page structure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 628.20 Tm (- CSS controls its look and layout.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 615.10 Tm (- JavaScript handles buttons, camera preview, hand-point drawing, feature numbers and API) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 603.00 Tm (      requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 589.90 Tm (- MediaPipe Hands finds hand points in browser frames.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 576.80 Tm (- Python and Flask run the backend API.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 563.70 Tm (- The scikit-learn-compatible model saved by Joblib predicts sign labels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 550.60 Tm (- SQLite can save continuous-sign samples in the training project.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 537.50 Tm (- Vercel hosts the website frontend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 524.40 Tm (- Render runs the backend and loads the saved models.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 511.30 Tm (- A service worker can save website files in the browser cache. This does not make live) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 499.20 Tm (      backend predictions work fully offline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 482.10 Tm (Do not describe the current backend as a TensorFlow or CNN system unless the code and model files) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 470.00 Tm (    are changed and checked. Explain what is actually in the project.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 447.90 Tm (8. Important API routes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 430.90 Tm (/api/health - checks whether the backend responds. It does not measure accuracy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 417.80 Tm (/api/status - shows model status and current model labels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 404.70 Tm (/api/predict-features - receives static numeric features from the current Live Studio workflow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 391.60 Tm (/api/predict - an older or alternate image route. Check the frontend before saying it is used in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 379.50 Tm (    the current workflow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 366.40 Tm (/api/sequence/predict - receives continuous-sequence features.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 353.30 Tm (/api/sequence/samples and /api/sequence/export - support continuous sample access as coded.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 340.20 Tm (/api/translate and /api/speech - support translation or speech. Some services need internet) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 328.10 Tm (    access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 311.00 Tm (When explaining a route, know what the browser sends and what the backend returns. Check) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 298.90 Tm (    frontend/studio.html and backend/web_app.py.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 276.80 Tm (9. Add and train a static sign) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 259.80 Tm (1. Back up the current CSV, active model and label file.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 246.70 Tm (2. Collect correctly labelled poses in data/landmarks_2hand.csv.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 233.60 Tm (3. Check that old labels and the new label are still present. Rows use a label and values) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 221.50 Tm (    v0 through v125.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 208.40 Tm (4. Train a trial model using train_model.py.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 195.30 Tm (5. Check that the candidate has 126 features and all expected labels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 182.20 Tm (6. Run python -m unittest test_sahayak.py.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 169.10 Tm (7. Test with fresh examples that were not used for training.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 156.00 Tm (8. If the results are acceptable, run python train_model.py --promote.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 142.90 Tm (9. Test old and new signs in the local website.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 129.80 Tm (10. Back up the deployed copy and copy only the active static model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 116.70 Tm (11. Commit only the intended model file, push it, wait for Render, check /api/status and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 104.60 Tm (    test the live site.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 87.50 Tm (Do not train on only the new sign if the model must keep recognizing old signs. The candidate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 75.40 Tm (    needs examples for every class that should remain.) Tj ET
