BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 658.20 Tm (9. Run python -m unittest test_sahayak.py test_sequence.py test_sequence_db.py.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 645.10 Tm (10. Test old and new signs locally.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 632.00 Tm (11. Copy only sahayak_sequence.joblib to the deployment project.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 618.90 Tm (12. Commit only the intended model file, wait for Render, check sequence_model_ready and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 606.80 Tm (    sequence_sign_labels, then test the live site.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 589.70 Tm (Do not replace the static model during a continuous-only update. Do not publish raw training) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 577.60 Tm (    databases or samples by mistake.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 555.50 Tm (11. How to test fairly) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 538.50 Tm (Keep test examples separate from training examples. Better still, use different recording sessions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 526.40 Tm (    or different signers for testing. Record how many examples were tested and how many were) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 514.30 Tm (    correct for each sign. Check which signs are confused. Test different lighting, camera) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 502.20 Tm (    distance, hand positions and movement speed. Quote an accuracy percentage only when a saved) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 490.10 Tm (    test report supports it. A successful demo or fast response is not proof of accuracy.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 468.00 Tm (12. Privacy and responsible use) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 451.00 Tm (The user should choose when to allow the camera. Explain when information is sent to the backend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 438.90 Tm (    Get permission from anyone who provides training examples. Keep training files safe. Do not) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 426.80 Tm (    store identifiable video or images without a clear need. Do not call this a guaranteed tool or) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 414.70 Tm (    recommend it for emergencies.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 392.60 Tm (13. Deploying updates) Tj ET
