BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 363.50 Tm (      deployment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 350.40 Tm (- Backend code or model change: test what you can locally, push the intended files and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 338.30 Tm (      confirm the Render deployment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 325.20 Tm (- Model-only change: normally does not require changing frontend code.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 312.10 Tm (- After a backend update, check /api/health and /api/status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 299.00 Tm (- Open the live website and test old as well as new signs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 281.90 Tm (If an update fails, check Git status, the browser console, the API response and the newest hosting) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 269.80 Tm (    logs. Do not reset your work or force-push just to hide an error.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 247.70 Tm (14. Quick troubleshooting) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 230.70 Tm (Camera does not open: check browser permission, camera selection and whether another app is using) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 218.60 Tm (    it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 205.50 Tm (Hand points do not line up: check mirroring and drawing coordinates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 192.40 Tm (Points appear but the label is wrong: check feature order, hand slots, model version, lighting and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 180.30 Tm (    label similarity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 167.20 Tm (New label is missing: check the active model, the deployed file, the Git commit and /api/status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 154.10 Tm (Backend is unavailable: check internet, Render status and deployment logs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 141.00 Tm (Website looks old: refresh after deployment; cached files may need a hard refresh.) Tj ET
