BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 780.00 Tm (Q: Is it a complete ISL translator? A: No. It predicts a limited set of trained labels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 766.90 Tm (Q: Why MediaPipe? A: It finds hand points that can be changed into numbers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 753.80 Tm (Q: Why 126 values? A: Two hands x 21 key points x three coordinates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 740.70 Tm (Q: Why 1,320 values? A: 132 values per frame across 10 time steps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 727.60 Tm (Q: Does adding a label file teach the model? A: No. New labelled examples, training, testing and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 715.50 Tm (    deployment are needed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 702.40 Tm (Q: How do you prove accuracy? A: Use a saved test report with examples kept separate from) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 690.30 Tm (    training.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 677.20 Tm (Q: Why separate frontend and backend? A: The browser handles the camera and display; the server) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 665.10 Tm (    loads the model and predicts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 652.00 Tm (Q: Does it work offline? A: Not fully. Live prediction and some extra services need a connection.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 638.90 Tm (Q: Can it be used in emergencies? A: No. It is a limited prototype and can be wrong.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 625.80 Tm (Q: What is useful about the project? A: It joins hand tracking, a trained classifier and a website) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 613.70 Tm (    into one system that can be tested.) Tj ET
